    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **What it does**\n1. Checks the **Form Response Sheet** for new department review form submissions.  \n2. Updates the **Checklist sheet** to mark the department’s review status as **\"Completed\"**.  \n3. Updates the **Form Responses sheet** to change the HR status to **\"Yes\"**.  \n4. Retrieves any pending reviews for reference.  \n",
