    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Overview**\nThis checks for submission due date and identifies department that needs attention.\n\n## **Flow Explanation**\n1. **Get 3 Days Before Submission Date (Code Node)**  \n   - Compares today’s date with each department’s **Review Due** date.  \n   - Flags items where the due date is exactly **3 days away** with a new field:  \n     - `isThreeDaysBefore = true`\n\n2. **If No Review Pending Status (IF Node)**  \n   - Checks if there's no more **\"Pending\"** status.  \n",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
